    "title": "Bloom Users",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "UUIDs are Identity account IDs. Public API through Gateway; internal endpoints only over a private network with a service credential. JSON bodies limited to 16 KiB. Exact location and birthDate are never included in PublicProfile."
  },
